# MegaFlash Apple-bus bring-up for MAME bridge (-a2bus-bridge).
# PHI0 so IsAppleConnected(); core1launch for BusLoop. No USB console.
# Cooperative guest-time is slow vs wall clock; launch core1 ASAP after crt0
# so BusLoop runs before core0 later-init HardFaults (_sbrk stack pop).

10ms: gpio20 1
10ms: gpio19 0
50ms: a2phi
200ms: core1launch
